{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ibsktm","slideIndex":0,"text":"20 seconds. Our project predicts hourly PM2.5 concentration for individual Almaty stations one, six and 24 hours ahead. We built both an evaluation workflow and an application. The central finding is a useful six-hour improvement, alongside important failures that constrain next-day use. Explain personal contributions truthfully if asked; this deck does not assign unverified team roles."}
