{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/zhx7fh","slideIndex":3,"text":"30 seconds. We preserve missing hours on an hourly grid so lag 24 means 24 elapsed hours, rather than 24 available readings. Features include the current value, nine lags, rolling means, standard deviations and observed counts. Calendar features use Almaty local time. Training fits imputation on training rows only. We never fill missing targets. Daily eligibility requires at least 18 observed hours out of 24. No weather or neighbouring-station inputs are included.\n\nSources: backend/app/features.py; backend/train_current.py"}
