{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8wocau","slideIndex":7,"text":"25 seconds. The independent historical station also shows the largest relative MAE improvement at six hours, approximately 22 percent. Ridge remains competitive and has better RMSE at some horizons. A history-versus-calendar validation ablation decreases six-hour MAE from 13.97 to 11.66, but calendar features slightly worsen next-day MAE. This ablation belongs to the historical experiment.\n\nSources: artifacts/test_metrics.csv; artifacts/validation_feature_ablation.csv"}
