{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/khnxz7","slideIndex":14,"text":"Use as a reference slide and do not read every citation aloud. Measurement attribution: AirData.kz and original providers. Methods: Chen and Guestrin 2016 and Hyndman and Athanasopoulos 2021. Empirical results come from the saved project manifests, test metrics and failure analysis, not these external papers. Supporting materials include the research paper, notebook, reproducible trainer, backend tests and application.\n\nSources: https://github.com/qazybekb/AirDatakz-OpenData; https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.02754; https://otexts.com/fpp3/; paper/Almaty_PM25_Research_Paper.docx"}